Mistral (s123) & FOLIO & 0.41 & 2.17 & 14.2 & $+$3.43 \\
Mistral (s456) & FOLIO & 0.40 & 2.22 & 14.2 & $-$0.49 \\
Mistral & PW-D5 & 0.21 & 3.63 & & $-$2.83 \\
